{"id":"491818","name":"鱿鱼丝丝瓜汤","author":"馋嘴乐","authorId":"285245","desc":"","cover":"images/491818/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"鱿鱼丝","amount":"30克"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"3克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主辅料：鱿鱼丝、丝瓜","img":"images/491818/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把鱿鱼丝切碎","img":"images/491818/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"丝瓜洗净去皮。","img":"images/491818/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把丝瓜片成薄片。","img":"images/491818/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧开水，放入切碎的鱿鱼丝。","img":"images/491818/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再放入丝瓜片。","img":"images/491818/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"烧开后放入葱花。","img":"images/491818/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入鸡粉、少许盐调味。","img":"images/491818/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再次烧开即可关火。","img":"images/491818/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅盛入碗中，即可上桌品味。","img":"images/491818/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"1、丝瓜可以用切片器刨成薄片。\n2、丝瓜不宜久煮。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}